 "playtime_at_review": 5285, "last_played": 1785114100, "avatar": "d067f4a22ebb51a010842bd0f782ed60cc5262c4"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very good game", "timestamp_created": 1780268342, "timestamp_updated": 1780268342, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1740578356", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "226904851", "author": {"steamid": "76561199141729185", "personaname": "afineguy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199141729185/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 11103, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8478, "last_played": 1785637867, "avatar": "0571fd4f9e88c82509847c1417b18ba2f7a754bf"}, "language": "english", "review": "Challenging but intuitive solo horror game becomes an all-timer horror/comedy party game when you bring your friends. The monsters are often terrifying but the game mechanics and aesthetics are really bleakly funny, from the other bumbling, bug-eyed robots on your team (complete with customizable expressions like angry, scared, and Evil Patrick) to your virtual overseer's efforts to motivate the crew with streams of ebullient emojis. It's worth taking a few moments as you work to take in the designs, because a lot of work went into sometimes very subtle jokes. But don't take too long looking because a monster will sneak up behind you and tear you apart with a deafening shriek.\n\nAs a bonus, the game runs fine on less impressive systems. I turned the graphics wayyyy down for my ancient, bog-standard laptop and I've had few problems besides the occasional glitch.", "timestamp_created": 1780268162, "timestamp_updated": 1780268162, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1740578356", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "226904284", "author": {"steamid": "76561199756245123", "personaname": "happy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199756245123/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 8020, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 4, "playtime_at_review": 7557, "last_played": 1790050698, "avatar": "2accfe78ece683d9c01eba5ad33d1c258c65eef0"}, "language": "english", "review": "the monsters are impossible to do and i cant see two feewt  in front of my face i do not reccamend", "timestamp_created": 1780267480, "timestamp_updated": 1780267480, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1740578356", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "226903709", "author": {"steamid": "76561199809910867", "personaname": "okdy1", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ffggffghhttyuyggjhftyu/", "num_games_owned": 57, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 4510, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1411, "last_played": 1785540608, "avatar": "c62543a5e9ed8f48af42b97174dd7e9689093d56"}, "language": "english", "review": "OHHH NO", "timestamp_created": 1780266802, "timestamp_updated": 1780266802, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1740578356", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "226903612", "